A||||6||Child Of Rod||Anyone put a racing fuel cell in their fiero?||||6||
Z||000000||Child Of Rod||08-01-2000||01:18 PM||||While I was installing one in my 66 mustang, I got to thinking...wouldn't it be nice to be able to put on in a fiero?<BR>Just thought I would throw that one out here.<BR>Back to work on the stang, then I have to go put a new hood on the t-top fiero.||||reg||6
Z||000001||William Federle||08-01-2000||01:22 PM||||I think a guy named "Batboy" did, and also a<BR>guy named "Spyder" - I think they both put a 5 gallon fuel cell in from Summit Eng.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000002||1FST2M6||08-01-2000||01:32 PM||||I'm sure some one has done it, and i'm sure there are advantages to it. but the biggest disadvantage would be the displacement of the weight. you're taking 70lbs of ballast out of the center of the car from as low as you can get on the car and moving it to a higher place raising the center of gravity and surly disrupting the handeling a bit. If you have a V8 or somthing that can toss the weight around like it's nothing than it's probly a good idea and i'm sure the local track officals wouldn't mind either. but for fun driving, or the best handling i would think... keep the weight low and in the center of the car..  <p>[This message has been edited by 1FST2M6 (edited 08-01-2000).]||||reg||1
Z||000003||Spyder||08-02-2000||09:57 AM||||I took out the spare tire and welded in a crossbeam then added sheet metal and then mounted the battery and an auxiliary five gallon gas tank in the front nose of the car. <BR>Also the factory sun roof does still fit. (I know, I don’t have a sunroof anymore but it still fits)<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.markalexandermiller.com/frntcompart.jpg">  <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.markalexandermiller.com/gastank.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by Spyder (edited 08-02-2000).]||||reg||1
Z||000004||DaRkLoRD||08-02-2000||03:58 PM||||Is it possible to fit a fuel cell in the stock location??<P>------------------<BR> <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A> <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||5
