Z||000006||PJ||08-03-2000||12:15 AM||||Yes, it is possible to fit a fuel cell in the stock location. Many manufacturers can fit a bladder inside  a stock fuel tank if you've got the $. Downside is the already paltry fuel capacity gets even smaller. BTW the tube frame IMSA Fiero ran with a cell in the stock location.<P>PJ<BR>ITA #66 Black<P><BR> ||||reg||1
